# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Format: /from /to STATUS
#
# Order matters: first match wins.
# Funnel-path rules MUST come before the apex catch-all so that
# tidesbookkeeping.com/tiered-pricing → go.subdomain (not www.).

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Legacy URLs from previous platforms → current pages
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
/home   /        301
/post   /blog    301

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Funnel paths → go. subdomain (works on apex AND www)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lead-magnet thank-you page: clean funnel URL → built file (Cloudflare ignores netlify.toml)
/tax-checklist/thanks            /tax-checklist-thanks.html                                      200

/tiered-pricing                  https://go.tidesbookkeeping.com/tiered-pricing                  301
/contact-info-for-pricing        https://go.tidesbookkeeping.com/contact-info-for-pricing        301
/pricing-engagement-agreement    https://go.tidesbookkeeping.com/pricing-engagement-agreement    301
/pricing                         https://go.tidesbookkeeping.com/tiered-pricing                  301
/pricing/                        https://go.tidesbookkeeping.com/tiered-pricing                  301

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Apex → www canonical redirect (catch-all)
# Note: if this doesn't fire reliably, set up a Cloudflare Dashboard
# Redirect Rule instead (Domain → Rules → Redirect Rules) — that
# operates at the edge before reaching Pages.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
https://tidesbookkeeping.com/*  https://www.tidesbookkeeping.com/:splat  301!
